(1859952, 106, 47803, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great shot.  I feel the composition might be slightly better if you''d angled the camera up very slightly (by placing coins underneath it), and turning it slightly to the right.  This would put the cue ball more off centre and you''d get more of the interesting window in the background.  That''s just my opinion though, and I don''t couldn''t do better with the focus or exposure.  Very well done!</td>', 'I think this is a great shot.  I feel the composition might be slightly better if you''d angled the camera up very slightly (by placing coins underneath it), and turning it slightly to the right.  This would put the cue ball more off centre and you''d get more of the interesting window in the background.  That''s just my opinion though, and I don''t couldn''t do better with the focus or exposure.  Very well done!', '2005-11-12 06:29:32.000000', NULL, 0),
