(5144785, 106, 72068, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by citymars:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mariposa_II:</b></div><hr/><i> seriously, this shot is well composed but i don''t seem to agree why this was the highest rated photo in the site. just an opinion. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Sending you a PM (personal message). </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I''d like the same pm too haha. I don''t think it''s that amazing? :S</td>', 'Originally posted by citymars: Originally posted by mariposa_II: seriously, this shot is well composed but i don''t seem to agree why this was the highest rated photo in the site. just an opinion.  Sending you a PM (personal message).   I''d like the same pm too haha. I don''t think it''s that amazing? :S', '2008-12-21 20:12:44.000000', NULL, 0),
