(39488, 106, 245, '<td valign="top">The lighting and shadows in this picture are so tasty, especially with the light that''s reflected onto the cue ball from the felt, and the curtains in the window. The green is such a good match. And I''m a sucker for a really narrow depth of field. Nice job!</td>', 'The lighting and shadows in this picture are so tasty, especially with the light that''s reflected onto the cue ball from the felt, and the curtains in the window. The green is such a good match. And I''m a sucker for a really narrow depth of field. Nice job!', '2002-02-25 18:50:00.000000', NULL, 0),
