(39518, 107, 324, '<td valign="top">This is a nicely framed shot with a good subject, but it needs white balance!  You could set the white point to the plate or table cloth in a curves adjustment in photoshop, but the best thing to do would be to set the white balance with the camera before you take the shot - it will be much less yellow</td>', 'This is a nicely framed shot with a good subject, but it needs white balance!  You could set the white point to the plate or table cloth in a curves adjustment in photoshop, but the best thing to do would be to set the white balance with the camera before you take the shot - it will be much less yellow', '2002-02-28 13:29:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(39519, 107, 574, '<td valign="top">it looks like you were in a restaurant and had a deadline for a film class an hour from then, so you took a picture ice cream because there was nothing else. you have bad style</td>', 'it looks like you were in a restaurant and had a deadline for a film class an hour from then, so you took a picture ice cream because there was nothing else. you have bad style', '2002-03-26 12:26:00.000000', NULL, 0),
