(39578, 124, 173, '<td valign="top">Cute pic. For what it''s worth, I would have cropped it a little tighterfrom side to side, making the pic an upright rectangle. Getting rid of the dead blask space on either side would keep the viewers'' eye from wandering. Cropping would also add to the long ears of the puppy.</td>', 'Cute pic. For what it''s worth, I would have cropped it a little tighterfrom side to side, making the pic an upright rectangle. Getting rid of the dead blask space on either side would keep the viewers'' eye from wandering. Cropping would also add to the long ears of the puppy.', '2002-02-28 11:31:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(39579, 124, 322, '<td valign="top">Cute. Might want to give us the background lighting as well.</td>', 'Cute. Might want to give us the background lighting as well.', '2002-02-28 12:15:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(39580, 124, 324, '<td valign="top">Top Notch!  How''d you get the dog not to blink when the flash went off?  Great action, great shot</td>', 'Top Notch!  How''d you get the dog not to blink when the flash went off?  Great action, great shot', '2002-02-28 13:41:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(39581, 124, 142, '<td valign="top">I just wanted to let everyone know that  the flash didn''t bother my dog in the least little bit.  He didn''t blink because he had absolutely no idea there was anything else in the world besides that cheese.  He ate cheese because I ran out of pizza before I got a shot that wasn''t blurry.</td>', 'I just wanted to let everyone know that  the flash didn''t bother my dog in the least little bit.  He didn''t blink because he had absolutely no idea there was anything else in the world besides that cheese.  He ate cheese because I ran out of pizza before I got a shot that wasn''t blurry.', '2002-03-01 00:48:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(39582, 124, 1, '<td valign="top">that''s good to know -- at least you didn''t feed him chocolate after the pizza ran out.</td>', 'that''s good to know -- at least you didn''t feed him chocolate after the pizza ran out.', '2002-03-06 11:49:00.000000', NULL, 0),
